        "body": "California Institute of Technology had obligations of $2.3B in FY21, $2.6B in FY22, and $2.7B in FY23. California Institute of Technology then had obligations of $2.2B in FY24, $2.3B in FY25, and $2.1B in FY26. California Institute of Technology's obligations are down 9.3% year over year for FY2026 to date."
      },
